{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33163","headline":"猎客 · 司马扎","name":"猎客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五陵射鵰客，走马占春光。\n下马青楼前，华裾独煌煌。\n自言家咸京，世族如金张。\n击钟传鼎食，尔来八十强。\n朱门争先开，车轮满路傍。\n娥娥燕赵人，珠箔闭高堂。\n清歌杂妙舞，临欢度曲长。\n朝游园花新，夜宴池月凉。\n更以驰骤多，意气事[强]梁。\n君王正年少，终日在长杨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司马扎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33163.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33163","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}